+
+Date: 2026-09-09  
+Investigator: Gemini (Worker in local multi-model control room)  
+Project: uoink-library  
+Reference Briefs:
+- `_scratch/P4-GUARD-DIAGNOSTIC-BRIEF-2026-09-09.md`
+- `docs/library/RYAN-FINAL-MEDIA-REPAIR-BRIEF-2026-09-09.md`
+Failed Test Run Reference:
